              "text": "An industrial fire at Kellet Point in Osmery prompted multiple warnings for Brayle and Sunder Flats and led to the closure of Kellet Road in the Kellet Point industrial estate and Merrin Canal. Fallon Coatings deployed an operator to the site. No casualties or injuries were reported in the available tweets.",
